# Form UI (synced)

Never use raw HTML form controls with custom one-off Tailwind in this project.

## Required components

- `Input`, `Select`, `Textarea` from `@/components/ui`
- `FormCard`, `FormGrid`, `FormActions` for layout
- `Button` for actions
- `LoadingOverlay` during submit

## Styles

Shared tokens in `src/components/ui/lib/form-styles.ts`:
- `formControlClass` — inputs/selects/textareas
- `formCardClass` — section containers
- `min-h-11`, `rounded-xl`, medical blue focus ring

## New forms checklist

1. Wrap sections in `FormCard`
2. Use `FormGrid` for side-by-side fields
3. Use `FormActions` for submit/cancel
4. Match login/signup/admin form spacing (`space-y-5` / `space-y-6`)
5. Mobile: full-width controls, `text-base` on inputs (iOS)

